Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: exynos8895: set the SM-G955N MICVDD voltage

Set the codec charge-pump supply to the board's 3 V setting as
specified in Samsung's dream2lte device tree. This is the supply for
the codec's independently regulated microphone bias outputs.

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos8895-dream2lteks.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos8895-dream2lteks.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos8895-dream2lteks.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos8895-dream2lteks.dts
@@ -494,7 +494,12 @@
 		CPVDD1-supply = <&g955n_codec_1v8>;
 		CPVDD2-supply = <&g955n_codec_1v2>;
 		DCVDD-supply = <&g955n_codec_1v2>;
+
+		micvdd {
+			regulator-min-microvolt = <3000000>;
+			regulator-max-microvolt = <3000000>;
+		};
 	};
 };
 
 &pinctrl_abox {
